# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-G7E4R`.
# `env -u ...` because a dispatch leaks its run id and home into subprocesses.
#
# orgasmic-cli has no lib target; its unit tests live in the binary, hence
# `--bin orgasmic`. Scoped to the module that owns the service-manager end of
# the shutdown-budget axis, so the replay exercises the two new relationship
# tests together with the `service_stop_timeout` derivation they are ordered
# against — and nothing else in the workspace.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-cli --bin orgasmic daemon_service::tests::
